- Full touched production/test files, fixtures, hooks, and assertions audited. Existing edge/failure coverage retained; no permanent skips or hollow assertions added.
- Fresh independent API-only review of the corrected exact source tree: **scoped-clean, zero P0–P2 findings**. Review included full unchanged public factory/downloader/HTTP/SSRF/cancellation/auth and actual runtime/tool/CLI implementations. This was source-only review, not independent test execution.

